error[E0277]: `len` in a postcondition reads a slice or a container, and `u64` is neither
 --> tests/compile_fail/ensures_len_of_scalar.rs:5:1
  |
5 | #[extern_fn(effect = pure, ensures(ret = len(n)))]
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a slice or a container
  |
  = help: the trait `acvus_extern::ensures::Length` is not implemented for `u64`
  = note: RFC-0082 rule 4: `len(x)` is the element count of a slice or a container parameter, or of `ret`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `acvus_extern::ensures::Length`:
            &T
            &mut T
            Arr<T, N>
            Vec<T>
            [T]
